Make parry and perfect-dodge windows longer or shorter to suit your timing.
[b]Highlights:[/b] Consistent same-side or opposite-side ripostes; dodge while blocking; adjustable dodge invulnerability duration.

[b][color=#A8D5C2][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thebloodofdawnwalker/mods/480]Combat Camera - Configurable[/url][/color][/b]
Choose how your camera follows enemies and how you select your targets.
[b]Highlights:[/b] Free, smooth or native tracking; camera-directed or fixed targets; automatic lock on hit; optional center dot.

[b][color=#A8D5C2][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thebloodofdawnwalker/mods/284]Fair Duelist - Customizable Difficulty[/url][/color][/b]
Build your own difficulty with precise control over combat balance.
[b]Highlights:[/b] Enemy health and damage; stamina costs; normal, low-health and ranged attack delays; coordinated enemy attacks.

[b][color=#A8D5C2][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thebloodofdawnwalker/mods/448]Health Regen - Configurable[/url][/color][/b]
Set separate health regeneration rates for your human and vampire forms.
[b]Highlights:[/b] Optional healing during combat; optional recovery of lost vampire segments; healing stops at the selected limit.

[size=4][b][color=#E8C88A]Controls and exploration[/color][/b][/size]

