Tailor your controller layout and make walking and menu access more comfortable.
[b]Highlights:[/b] 31 controller settings; wider walking range; short press for Map, long press for Game Hub; controller stutter fixes.

[b][color=#A8D5C2][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thebloodofdawnwalker/mods/449]Press to Gather - Configurable[/url][/color][/b]
Gather nearby harvestable resources with one keyboard press or controller hold.
