[b][color=#A8D5C2][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thebloodofdawnwalker/mods/711]Less Wildlife[/url][/color][/b]
Make ordinary boar herds and wolf packs smaller—or larger.
[b]Highlights:[/b] Population from 10% to 200%; separate boar and wolf switches; quest and named animals keep their normal values.

[size=4][b][color=#E8C88A]Your view, your style[/color][/b][/size]

